    "question": {
        "text": "§\n\nName 2 gram (-) organisms which can be treated with Penicillin",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nName 2 gram (-) organisms which can be treated with Penicillin\n\n(1) Treponema pallidum\n(2) Neisseria meningitis\n\n(Note: Penicillin can only treat meningitis due Neisseria meningitidis, as the inflammation opens the pores in the BBB, allowing the drug to enter the CNS)\n\n[Image: 6c21eed5e558be0bcb387babc2e0cbec17d4dc4240fe99d4447bb530e984f6b9]\n\n[Image: 0612d05d476cb9e8878e6408f74cf09d9967777678c59213ad3711725f8f1222]\n\n1.1 - Penicillin\n[Image: f713488a5c800aa8470570b237c9db1cc080a90502f28209a5055b7b9d91c056]\n\n[Image: 5749219917b0d46cdacdcfd16cb18400fe3c5f4acbba8ea5f1fe0b81fe3ca819]",
